{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56263","headline":"偈 · 李仁悦","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日古伽蓝，名爲王董龛。\n数载无僧俗，积岁少人瞻。\n县镇兴三善，率土尽庄严。\n我佛□□□，□□□□□。\n（《八琼室金石补正》卷八一绍□撰《普慈县永封里再兴王董龛报国院碑记》附。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李仁悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}